%% Use Case Diagram
flowchart LR
Borrower((Borrower)) --> Register[Register / login]
Borrower --> Profile[View/update own profile]
Borrower --> Apply[Submit application]
Borrower --> OwnRecords[View own applications, loans, repayments, balance]
Borrower --> Verify[View blockchain history]
Officer((Loan Officer)) --> Review[Review pending applications]
Officer --> Decision[Approve or reject]
Officer --> Manage[Record disbursement / repayment]
Officer --> LoanView[View active/completed loans]
Admin((Administrator)) --> Users[Manage users and roles]
Admin --> Monitor[Monitor system and loan activity]
